  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.6 Derive weightPower",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Derive weightPower from the power-law fit in [fMinHz, fMaxHz] *)\nModule[{s = DCTAdmittanceStats`FilterAdmittanceStats[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]},\n  weightPower = s[\"WeightPowerDerived\"];\n  Print[\"weightPower \\[LeftArrow] \", NumberForm[weightPower, {4, 2}],\n    \"   (\\[Alpha] = \", NumberForm[s[\"PowerLawAlpha\"], {4, 2}], \")\"]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">weightPower ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7jrk-j8vrhgd\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7LTEuMTF9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-1.11</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   (α = </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7jrm-ufkqo8l\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MS4xMX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.11</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: weightPower ←[formula]   (α =[formula])",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3ad72524-bf78-405e-bf4d-0c6ffe8e61a4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Parameter Tuning\nEach sweep fits the representative file over a range of one parameter (others locked from the params cell). Adjust ranges as needed, then update params cell.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3.1 Tau grid",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Tau grid padding: the grid extends tauMinFactor/tauMaxFactor beyond the direct\n   1/(2pi*fMax) and 1/(2pi*fMin) limits. Extra range prevents Tikhonov edge artifacts\n   — peaks near the boundaries of the plot are outside the data window and suspect. *)\ntauMinFactor = 0.1;   (* decade below fMax: tau_min = tauMinFactor/(2pi*fMax) *)\ntauMaxFactor = 10.;   (* decade above fMin: tau_max = tauMaxFactor/(2pi*fMin) *)\n\nPrint[\"Tau grid: \",\n  NumberForm[tauMinFactor/(2 Pi fMaxHz), {3,2}], \" \\[LongDash] \",\n  NumberForm[tauMaxFactor/(2 Pi fMinHz), {3,2}], \" s  (data window: \",\n  NumberForm[1./(2 Pi fMaxHz), {3,4}], \" — \",\n  NumberForm[1./(2 Pi fMinHz), {3,2}], \" s)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Tau grid: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7jrx-kl8c50k\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wMH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> — </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7jrz-igz9hg1\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi4wMH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.00</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> s  (data window: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7js0-6qngu50\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wMDAzfQ==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0003</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> — </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7js1-jjecpci\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4yMH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> s)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Tau grid:[formula] —[formula] s  (data window:[formula] —[formula] s)",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "30ac2f18-39b3-4de0-84e1-f8ebcaeb6242"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3.2 Lambda sweep",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Compute g(k) spectrum for each λ — used by the L-curve and verification plot below *)\nlambdas = {0, 1*^-5, 1*^-4, 3*^-4, 0.001, 0.003, 0.01, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3};\nlSweep  = DCTSensitivity`LambdaSweep[repFile, lambdas,\n  \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n  \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n  \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n  \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n  \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n  \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n];\nlSweepSpecs = Map[\n  <|\"File\" -> \"\\[Lambda]=\" <> ToString[#[\"Lambda\"]], \"Spec\" -> #[\"Spec\"]|> &,\n  Select[lSweep, AssociationQ[#[\"Spec\"]] &]\n];\nPrint[Length[lSweepSpecs], \" \\[Lambda] values computed.\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7kcj-u7cwq6x\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"MTA=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> λ values computed.</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula] λ values computed.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "803928cd-2b5e-49dc-a464-c6333696642a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a. L-curve: choosing λ\nPlot of roughness ∥D²g∥ (x-axis) vs data misfit ∥Y – Ŷ∥ (y-axis) for each λ tested above. λ increases from bottom-right (spiky spectrum, low misfit) toward top-left (smooth spectrum, high misfit). The **corner** — maximum curvature — is the optimal balance point.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.1 Plot L-curve",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* L-curve: roughness ||D²g|| vs weighted admittance misfit sqrt(sum w_i |DeltaY_i|^2)\n   The weighted misfit is what NNLS actually minimises — has more dynamic range than ObjY. *)\nlCurveData = Table[\n  Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]], yD, yF, w},\n    yD = sp[\"YIntData\"];\n    yF = sp[\"YIntFit\"];\n    w  = Abs[yD]^weightPower;  (* same weighting as inner NNLS solve *)\n    { Norm[Differences[Differences[sp[\"g\"]]]],           (* roughness: ||D²g||      *)\n      Sqrt[Total[w * (Re[yF-yD]^2 + Im[yF-yD]^2)]] }    (* weighted misfit: ||WDY|| *)\n  ], {i, Length[lSweepSpecs]}];\n\nListLogLogPlot[\n  lCurveData,\n  Joined         -> True,\n  PlotStyle      -> Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], AbsoluteThickness[1.5]],\n  PlotMarkers    -> {Graphics[{White, Disk[{0,0},1]}], 0.03},\n  Frame          -> True,\n  Axes           -> False,\n  Background     -> GrayLevel[0.12],\n  FrameStyle     -> Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]],\n  LabelStyle     -> Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 13],\n  FrameLabel     -> {\n    {Style[\"Weighted misfit  \\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]\\[Sqrt]w \\[CenterDot] \\[CapitalDelta]Y\\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]\", 14, White], None},\n    {Style[\"Roughness  \\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]D\\[CenterDot]D\\[CenterDot]g\\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]  (F/dec)\", 14, White], None}\n  },\n  Epilog -> Join[\n    MapThread[\n      Style[Text[#2, {Log[#1[[1]]], Log[#1[[2]]]}, {-1.3, 0.5}], White, 11] &,\n      {lCurveData, lSweepSpecs[[All, \"File\"]]}],\n    {Style[Text[\"\\[LeftArrow] smoother\",  Scaled[{0.12, 0.95}], {-1, 1}], GrayLevel[0.55], 11],\n     Style[Text[\"better fit \\[RightArrow]\", Scaled[{0.88, 0.05}], {1, -1}], GrayLevel[0.55], 11]}\n  ],\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.18],\n  ImageSize        -> 500,\n  AspectRatio      -> 0.8\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"18\" data-out-n=\"66\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"36\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[66]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_12xcc8jyfruuf.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_12xcc8jyfruuf.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* L-curve: roughness ||D²g|| vs weighted admittance misfit sqrt(sum w_i |DeltaY_i|^2)\n   The weighted misfit is what NNLS actually minimises — has more dynamic range than ObjY. *)\nlCurveData = Table[\n  Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]], yD, yF, w},\n    yD = sp[\"YIntData\"];\n    yF = sp[\"YIntFit\"];\n    w  = Abs[yD]^weightPower;  (* same weighting as inner NNLS solve *)\n    { Norm[Differences[Differences[sp[\"g\"]]]],           (* roughness: ||D²g||      *)\n      Sqrt[Total[w * (Re[yF-yD]^2 + Im[yF-yD]^2)]] }    (* weighted misfit: ||WDY|| *)\n  ], {i, Length[lSweepSpecs]}];\n\nListLogLogPlot[\n  lCurveData,\n  Joined         -> True,\n  PlotStyle      -> Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], AbsoluteThickness[1.5]],\n  PlotMarkers    -> {Graphics[{White, Disk[{0,0},1]}], 0.03},\n  Frame          -> True,\n  Axes           -> False,\n  Background     -> GrayLevel[0.12],\n  FrameStyle     -> Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]],\n  LabelStyle     -> Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 13],\n  FrameLabel     -> {\n    {Style[\"Weighted misfit  \\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]\\[Sqrt]w \\[CenterDot] \\[CapitalDelta]Y\\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]\", 14, White], None},\n    {Style[\"Roughness  \\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]D\\[CenterDot]D\\[CenterDot]g\\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]  (F/dec)\", 14, White], None}\n  },\n  Epilog -> Join[\n    MapThread[\n      Style[Text[#2, {Log[#1[[1]]], Log[#1[[2]]]}, {-1.3, 0.5}], White, 11] &,\n      {lCurveData, lSweepSpecs[[All, \"File\"]]}],\n    {Style[Text[\"\\[LeftArrow] smoother\",  Scaled[{0.12, 0.95}], {-1, 1}], GrayLevel[0.55], 11],\n     Style[Text[\"better fit \\[RightArrow]\", Scaled[{0.88, 0.05}], {1, -1}], GrayLevel[0.55], 11]}\n  ],\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.18],\n  ImageSize        -> 500,\n  AspectRatio      -> 0.8\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a623c291-a20f-44ec-9f12-324990635458"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.2 Set λ",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* From the L-curve above: corner is around λ ≈ 10⁻³ — roughness drops steeply below,\n   misfit is flat above. Lock it in for the drift fit. *)\nlambdaND = 1*^-3;\nPrint[Style[\"lambdaND ← \", Bold, White], Style[lambdaND, Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7kwx-i1480is\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyNmZmZmZmZ9e1x0ZXh0e2xhbWJkYU5EICRcZ2V0cyQgfX19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">lambdaND </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq6c7kwy-57zxi7j\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyMwMGZmMDB9e1xmcmFjezF9ezEwMDB9fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"color:#00ff00;border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula][formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f123c004-b82d-437a-898d-baf535ba70da"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.3 Verify λ",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right) *)\nModule[{n, cols, styles, fTicks, magTraces, phaseTraces,\n        gkPlot, magPlot, phasePlot, darkBg, fgSt, lblSt},\n\n  darkBg = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgSt   = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]];\n  lblSt  = Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"];\n\n  n      = Length[lSweepSpecs];\n  cols   = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.90/Max[n-1,1]}];\n  styles = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ cols;\n  fTicks = Table[{10.^p, Superscript[10, p]},\n             {p, Floor[Log10[fMinHz]], Ceiling[Log10[fMaxHz]]}];\n\n  magTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        100. Abs[sp[\"YIntFit\"] - sp[\"YIntData\"]] / Abs[sp[\"YIntData\"]]}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  phaseTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        (Arg[sp[\"YIntFit\"]] - Arg[sp[\"YIntData\"]]) * 180/Pi}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  gkPlot = DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, Automatic, ImageSize -> 460];\n\n  magPlot = ListLinePlot[magTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"|\" <> \"\\[CapitalDelta]\" <> \"Y| / |Y| (%)\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {0, Automatic}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  phasePlot = ListLinePlot[phaseTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"\\[CapitalDelta]Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  Row[{gkPlot, Spacer[12], Column[{magPlot, phasePlot}, Spacings -> 0.3]},\n    Alignment -> Center]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"19\" data-out-n=\"69\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"53\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[69]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_fqxtzjvepe89.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_fqxtzjvepe89.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right) *)\nModule[{n, cols, styles, fTicks, magTraces, phaseTraces,\n        gkPlot, magPlot, phasePlot, darkBg, fgSt, lblSt},\n\n  darkBg = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgSt   = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]];\n  lblSt  = Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"];\n\n  n      = Length[lSweepSpecs];\n  cols   = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.90/Max[n-1,1]}];\n  styles = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ cols;\n  fTicks = Table[{10.^p, Superscript[10, p]},\n             {p, Floor[Log10[fMinHz]], Ceiling[Log10[fMaxHz]]}];\n\n  magTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        100. Abs[sp[\"YIntFit\"] - sp[\"YIntData\"]] / Abs[sp[\"YIntData\"]]}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  phaseTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        (Arg[sp[\"YIntFit\"]] - Arg[sp[\"YIntData\"]]) * 180/Pi}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  gkPlot = DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, Automatic, ImageSize -> 460];\n\n  magPlot = ListLinePlot[magTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"|\" <> \"\\[CapitalDelta]\" <> \"Y| / |Y| (%)\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {0, Automatic}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  phasePlot = ListLinePlot[phaseTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"\\[CapitalDelta]Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  Row[{gkPlot, Spacer[12], Column[{magPlot, phasePlot}, Spacings -> 0.3]},\n    Alignment -> Center]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "66ee8b43-3900-4602-902f-d816a9d45d78"
    }
