  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Drift Fit\nRun once (or after changing parameters). `driftFiles` and `goodSpecs` are used by the plot cells below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4.1 Batch drift fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "driftFiles = sortFiles[\n  Take[\n    sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]],\n    ;; ;; fileDecimation\n  ]\n];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" files (decimated) from \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\nresults = Table[\n  Module[{spec},\n    If[Mod[i, Max[1, Round[Length[driftFiles]/10]]] == 1,\n      Print[i, \" / \", Length[driftFiles], \"  \", FileNameTake[driftFiles[[i]]]]\n    ];\n    spec = Quiet @ Check[\n      DCT`DCTSpectrum[driftFiles[[i]],\n        \"LambdaND\"      -> lambdaND,\n        \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n        \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n        \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n        \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n        \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n        \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n      ], $Failed\n    ];\n    <|\"File\" -> driftFiles[[i]], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n  ],\n  {i, Length[driftFiles]}\n];\n\ngoodSpecs = Select[results, #OK === True &];\nPrint[Style[ToString[Length[goodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[driftFiles]] <> \" fits succeeded.\", Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
