  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a. Drift Plots\nRun each cell independently. `goodSpecs` must exist (run the fit cell above first).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.1 g(k) by electrode",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order) *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
