       "data": "Print: Found[formula] concentration files.Nominal fit range:[formula] –[formula] HzActual freq range:[formula] –[formula] Hz  ([formula] points)[formula] /[formula]E1 0 μM[formula] /[formula]E1 178 μM[formula] /[formula]E2 0 μM[formula] /[formula]E2 178 μM[formula] /[formula]E3 0 μM[formula] /[formula]E3 178 μM[formula]",
