  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.2 g(k) spectra",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Concentration g(k) spectra — one electrode *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"44\" data-out-n=\"157\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"33\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[157]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_mfyjx2qh3i0l.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_mfyjx2qh3i0l.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Concentration g(k) spectra — one electrode *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8cf3fba7-792a-4b31-a4e7-74b472d618f5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3 Area-normalised g(k)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Concentration g(k) — area-normalised (each curve divided by its total capacitance) *)\nconcE1Norm = Table[\n  Module[{s, spec, area},\n    s    = concE1[[i]];\n    spec = s[\"Spec\"];\n    area = DCTPeakAnalysis`IntegrateSpectrum[spec];\n    <|s, \"Spec\" -> <|spec, \"g\" -> spec[\"g\"] / Max[area, 1*^-15]|>|>\n  ],\n  {i, Length[concE1]}\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1Norm, Automatic,\n  FrameLabel -> {\n    Style[Row[{\"Electron-transfer rate, k (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 16, White],\n    Style[Row[{\"g(k) / C\", Subscript[\"dist\", \"\"], \"  (\", Superscript[\"decade\", -1], \")\"}], 16, White]\n  }\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"45\" data-out-n=\"159\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"34\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[159]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_12gr6bkf8ks4n.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_12gr6bkf8ks4n.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Concentration g(k) — area-normalised (each curve divided by its total capacitance) *)\nconcE1Norm = Table[\n  Module[{s, spec, area},\n    s    = concE1[[i]];\n    spec = s[\"Spec\"];\n    area = DCTPeakAnalysis`IntegrateSpectrum[spec];\n    <|s, \"Spec\" -> <|spec, \"g\" -> spec[\"g\"] / Max[area, 1*^-15]|>|>\n  ],\n  {i, Length[concE1]}\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1Norm, Automatic,\n  FrameLabel -> {\n    Style[Row[{\"Electron-transfer rate, k (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 16, White],\n    Style[Row[{\"g(k) / C\", Subscript[\"dist\", \"\"], \"  (\", Superscript[\"decade\", -1], \")\"}], 16, White]\n  }\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "96f475df-e4b7-4c12-87a1-43246ca6413c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.4 Fraction folded",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Fraction folded vs [ligand].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) — naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[\n  StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, {\"E1\", \"E2\", \"E3\"}}\n];\n\n(* exclude 0 \\[Mu]M from log-axis plot *)\nconcGrid = ffPerElectrode[[1, All, 1]];\nposIdx   = Select[Range[Length[concGrid]], concGrid[[#]] > 0 &];\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ {1,2,3};\n\nListLinePlot[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]],\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {\n    Style[\"[Ligand] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White],\n    Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, 1200}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, {\"E1\",\"E2\",\"E3\"},\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg,\n                         FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"138\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"36\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"49\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[138]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_ej78h2fx6ui8.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_ej78h2fx6ui8.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Fraction folded vs [ligand]\n   k_peak shifts from range 1 (~46 s-1, unbound) to range 2 (~184 s-1, bound).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) — naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[\n  StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, {\"E1\", \"E2\", \"E3\"}}\n];\n\n(* exclude 0 µM from log-axis plot *)\nconcGrid = ffPerElectrode[[1, All, 1]];\nposIdx   = Select[Range[Length[concGrid]], concGrid[[#]] > 0 &];\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ {1,2,3};\n\nListLinePlot[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]],\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {\n    Style[\"[Ligand] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White],\n    Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, 1200}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, {\"E1\",\"E2\",\"E3\"},\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg,\n                         FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "868a4ea9-f382-4d74-ae8d-0b2d154f067d"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a. Biophysical Model Fits\n\nFits the mechanistic kinetic model to fraction-folded vs concentration data pooled across all electrodes.\n\n**3-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B): all aptamers can fold. Parameters: K_S (structural switching equilibrium), K_D (ligand dissociation constant). Baseline ff at zero ligand is K_S / (1 + K_S).\n\n**4-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B + NF non-folding): fraction NF is permanently unfolded regardless of ligand. Parameters: K_S, K_D, NF. The 4-state K_D is typically much smaller than the 3-state K_D because NF absorbs the saturation shortfall rather than inflating K_D.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a.1 Fit and log-linear plot",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Biophysical model fits using the mechanistic 3-state and 4-state kinetic models.\n   Data: {conc µM, ff} across all electrodes, positive concentrations only. *)\n\n(* --- model equations --- *)\nPrint[Style[\"3-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF3State}]];\nPrint[Style[\"4-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B,  NF non-folding)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF4State}]];\nPrint[\"\"];\n\nallPts = Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]], 1];\n\nfitResult = DCTBiophysics`FitFoldedFraction[allPts];\n\n(* --- fit parameters --- *)\nModule[{p3 = fitResult[\"Model3\"], p4 = fitResult[\"Model4\"]},\n  Print[Style[\"3-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}]];\n  Print[Style[\"4-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\",\n             \"     NF = \", NumberForm[p4[\"NF\"], {3,2}]}]]\n];\n\n(* --- plot --- *)\nModule[{ks3, kd3, ks4, kd4, nf4, m3, m4,\n        tMin, tMax, c3pts, c4pts,\n        darkBg, fgStyle, eCols, modelStyles},\n  ks3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KS\"];  kd3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KD\"];\n  ks4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KS\"];  kd4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KD\"];\n  nf4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"NF\"];\n\n  (* substitute numeric params into public symbolic expressions *)\n  m3 = DCTBiophysics`$FF3State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks3, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd3};\n  m4 = DCTBiophysics`$FF4State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks4, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd4,\n                                    DCTBiophysics`NF -> nf4};\n\n  tMin = Log10[Min[allPts[[All,1]]] * 0.4];\n  tMax = Log10[Max[allPts[[All,1]]] * 3.];\n\n  (* sample at 200 log-spaced points as {µM, ff} — same coordinate space as data *)\n  c3pts = Table[{10^t, N[m3 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n  c4pts = Table[{10^t, N[m4 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n\n  darkBg     = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgStyle    = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\n  eCols      = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Opacity[0.65]] & /@ {1,2,3};\n  modelStyles = {\n    Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n    Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]]\n  };\n\n  ListLinePlot[\n    Join[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]], {c3pts, c4pts}],\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Joined -> True,\n    PlotMarkers -> {{Automatic,8},{Automatic,8},{Automatic,8}, None, None},\n    PlotStyle -> Join[eCols, modelStyles],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Ligand] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White],\n                   Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.8, 1200}, {0, 1}},\n    PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    ImageSize -> 540, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, {\"E1\",\"E2\",\"E3\"},\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n      LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg,\n                           FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right],\n    Epilog -> {\n      {Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n       Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.91}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.91}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"3-state model\", GrayLevel[0.65], 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n           Scaled[{0.79, 0.91}]],\n      {Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n       Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.83}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.83}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"4-state model\", White, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n           Scaled[{0.79, 0.83}]]\n    }\n  ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq72najm-r57kvai\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dHszLXN0YXRlIG1vZGVsICAoVSAkXGxlZnRyaWdodGFycm93JCBGICRcbGVmdHJpZ2h0YXJyb3ckIEIpfX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3-state model (U </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> F </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> B)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
